hadiths[139]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1897","Abu Musa (radiyAllahu 'anhu) ke zimn-e rivayat se marwi hai, Nabi Muhammad (sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Mardon mein se bo log kamal ko pahunch chuke hain"
"1898","Ubaidullah bin Abdullah ne Abu Sa'eed (رضي الله عنه) se Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ki ek riwayat rawana ki."
"1899","Hazrat Eisa bin Abdullah bin Unais (raziyallahu anhu) ne apni taraf se riwayat ki, aur unke walid (raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: \Main ne Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke woh ek latka hua mashk (paani ka mashk) ke saath khade the.\"""""
"1900","Hazrat Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Amrah (رحمہ اللہ) نے اپنی دادی Kabshah (رضی اللہ عنہا) سے روایت کی ہے کہ انہوں نے فرمایا: \رسول اللہ ﷺ میرے پاس تشریف لائے۔ آپ ﷺ نے لٹکتے ہوئے مشک سے کھڑے کھڑے پانی پیا۔ پھر میں اس کے منہ پر گئی اور اسے کاٹ دیا۔\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمہ اللہ) نے کہا:] یہ حدیث حسن صحیح غریب ہے۔ Yazid bin Yazid bin Jabir، Abdur-Rahman bin Yazid bin Jabir کے بھائی ہیں۔ ان کا انتقال ان سے پہلے ہوا۔"""
"1901","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke: \Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ke paas kuch doodh laya gaya jo thoda paani milaya hua tha. Unki daayi taraf ek Arabi (Bedouin) baitha tha aur baayi taraf Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq (رضي الله"""
"1902","Abu Qatadah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs lwgwn kw pany plata hay، wh an myn sb say aakhr myn pyta hay۔\"" anhwn nay kha: as bab myn abn aby awfy (rz all anh) say bhy rwayt hay۔ [abw aysyٰ (rhmt allh alyh) nay kha:] yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔"""
"1903","Hazrat Aisha (rzy allh anha) rwayt krty hyn kh: \rswl allh (ﷺ) kw sb say zyadh psndydh mshrwb mytha hwta tha۔\"""""
"1904","Hazrat Zuhri (Razi Allah unho) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) se pucha gaya: \Sab se behtar peyaab (sharbat) kaunsa hai?\"" Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Meetha aur thanda paani.\"""""
"1905","Abdah ibn Abdullah al-Khuza'i al-Basri ne riwayat ki ke: humein Mu'awiyah ibn Hisham ne bayan kiya, wo Sufyan se, wo Muharib ibn Dithar se, wo Jabir (رضي الله عنه) se, aur wo Nabi Kareem (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) se, farmaya: \Sirka kitna achha masala hai!\"" \nYeh hadees Mubarak ibn Sa'id ki hadees se zyada sahih (اصحّ) hai."""
"1906","Ibn Mas'ud ne farmaya: \Maine Rasool Allah se poocha: 'Aey Allah ke Rasool! Aamal mein sab se afzal aamal kaun sa hai?' Unhon ne farmaya: 'Salat apne waqt par padhna.' Maine kaha: 'Phir kya?'"""
"1907","Abdullah bin Amr (razi Allahu anhuma) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Rab ki raza maandi waldain ki raza maandi mein hai.\"""""
"1908","Abu 'Abdur-Rahman As-Sulami ne Abu Ad-Darda' RadiAllahu Anhu se riwayat ki. Unhon ne farmaya ke ek aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: \Meri ek biwi hai jise meri walida ne mujhe talaq dene ka hukm diya hai.\"" Abu Ad-Darda' RadiAllahu Anhu ne farmaya: \""Main ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko farmaate suna ke: 'Walid (baap) jannat ka darmiyan darwaza hai. Pas agar tum chaho to ise rok sakte ho"
"1909","Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Bakrah ne apni walid se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Kya tumhein sab se bade gunaahon ki khabar na doon?\"" Hum ne arz kiya: \""Bilkul"
"1910","Abdullah bin 'Amr (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Sab se bara gunah yeh hai ke apne walidain ko laanat kare.\"" Sahaba ne arz kiya: \""Ya Rasoolullah! Kya koi shakhs apne walidain ko laanat deta hai?\"" Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Haan"
"1911","Ibn 'Umar (Razi Allah unhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Aamaal-e-saalihah mein se aik aamaal yeh hai ke aadmi apne walid ke dost aur rishtedaaron se muhabbat aur sila-e-rahim barqarar rakhe.\"""""
"1912","Al-Bara' bin Azib (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke: Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Khalah (maan ki behan) ka darjah maan ke barabar hai.\"""""
"1913","Abu Harairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Teen duaon ki qubool hoti hain.\"""""
"1914","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Beta apne baadshah ke haq ada nahi kar sakta.\"""""
"1915","Abu Salamah ne farmaya: \Abu Ar-Raddad Al-Laithi ne (bimari ki) shikayat ki. To 'Abdur-Rahman bin 'Awf ne usse mulaqat ki. Unhon ne khaas taur par farmaya: 'Tum mein se behtareen shakhs woh hai...'\"""""
"1916","Abdullah bin Amr (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh nby akrm ﷺ nay frmaya: \srf rshtwn kw qaym rkhna kafy nhyn۔ blkh rshtwn kw jwrna as wqt hwta hay jb as kay rhm (rshth) ka talq twt jayay awr wh asay dwbarh jwr day۔\"""""
"1917","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah unho) ne Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Jab tum mein se kisi ka apna naukar uske liye khana tayyar kare"
"1918","Yūsuf ibn Ḥammād al-Maʿnī al-Baṣrī ne ham se riwāyat kī, ʿUthmān ibn ʿAbd al-Raḥmān al-Jumaḥī ne riwāyat kī, Muḥammad ibn Ziyād se, Abū Hurayrah (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) se, aur Nabī ﷺ se riwāyat karte hain ke ﷺ ne farmāyā:\n\n\Salām phailāo"
"1919","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \n\Aqra bin Habis (raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi ﷺ ko Hasan (raziyallahu anhu) ko chumte dekha.\"" \nIbn Abi Umar (rawi) ne kaha: \""Hasan aur Husain (raziyallahu anhuma) ko.\"" \nAqra ne kaha: \""Mere das aulad hain aur main kisi ko nahi chumta.\"" \nRasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \n\""Jis ne reham na kiya"
"1920","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (Razi Allah unho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Koi banda jo teen betiyaan rakhta ho...\"""""
"1921","Aishah (raziyallahu anha) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jis shakhs ko kuch betiyon (daughters) se imtihaan mein mubtila kiya gaya...\"""""
"1922","Abu Bakr bin Ubaidullah bin Anas bin Malik ne Anas (رضي الله عنہ) se riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \جو شخص دو لڑکیوں کو پالے گا تو میں اور وہ جنت میں اس طرح داخل ہوں گے جیسے یہ دو انگلیاں قریب ہیں۔\"" اور آپ نے اپنی دو انگلیوں کی طرف اشارہ فرمایا۔"""
"1923","Aishah (rzy allh anha) nay frmaya: \ayk awrt myray pas aayy awr as kay sath as ky dw bytyan thyn۔ wh mjh say (khanay kay lyay) mang rhy thy lykn myray pas ayk khjwr kay swa kchh nhyn tha۔ myn nay wh asay day dy awr as nay khwd asay khayay bghyr apny dwnwn bytywn kay drmyan tqsym kr dya۔ phr wh ath kr chlnay lgy۔\"""""
"1924","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \جو شخص کے تین بیٹیاں ہوں"""
"1925","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke: Nabi Kareem (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \جو شخص مسلمان یتیم بچے کو اپنے سہرے میں لے کر اسے پالے اور اس کی تربیت کرے...\"""""
"1926","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney « مجثمة » aur gandagi khaney waley janwer key doodh aur mashk key munh sey pani peeney sey mana farmaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Muhammad bin Bashaar kehtey hain : hum sey ibn Adi ney (an Saeed bin abi Aruba an Qatada an Akrama an ibne-Abbas an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) ki sanad sey isi jaisi hadees bayan ki hai. 3- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr sey bhi hadees marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
"1927","main abu-Musa key paas gaya, wo murghi kha rahey they, kaha : qarib ho jaao aur khaao isliye ke mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko isey khatey dekha hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai, Zahdam sey ye hadees dusri sanadon sey bhi aai hai, hum isey sirf Zahdam hi ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
"1928","Mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko murgh ka gosht khatey dekha. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is hadees mein kuch aur baaten bhi hain. 3- Ayub Sakhtiyaan ney bhi is hadees ko : (عن القاسم التميمي an أبي قلابة an"
"1929","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath hubaari (surkhaab) ka gosht khaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 3- Ibrahim bin umr bin Safina sey ibne-Abi Fidya ney bhi riwayat ki hai, inhen Bareed bin umr bin Safina bhi kaha gaya hai."
"1930","unhoney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki khidmat mein bhuni dast pesh ki, aap ney is mein sey khaya , phir namaz key liye khadey huye aur wuzu nahin kya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Haris , Mughira aur abu-Raafey (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"1931","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''main tek laga kar nahin khata.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- hum isey sirf Ali bin Aqmar ki riwayat sey jantey hain, Ali bin Aqmar sey is hadees ko Zakariya bin abi zyada , Sufiyan bin Saeed Sory aur kaee logon ney riwayat kiya hai, Shoba ney ye hadees Sufiyan Sory sey Ali bin Aqmar key wastey sey riwayat ki hai. 3- is bab mein Ali , Abdullah bin Amr aur Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"1932","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam meethi chiz aur shehad ko pasand kartey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai. 2- isey Ali bin Mus'hir ney bhi Hisham bin Urwa key wastey sey riwayat ki hai. 3- hadees mein is sey ziyada baaten hain."
"1933","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab tum mein sey koi gosht khareedey to is mein (pakaatey waqt) shorbaa (salan) ziyada kar ley, isliye ke agar wo gosht na paa sakey to usey shorbaa mil jaey, wo bhi do gosht mein sey eik gosht hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is baab mein Abu-Zar sey bhi riwayat hai, 2- hum isey sirf isi sanad sey Muhammad bin Fazaa ki riwayat sey jantey hain, Muhammad bin Fazaa Muabbir (yani khuwab ki tabeer bayan karney waley) hain, in key barey mein Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Harab ney kalam kiya hai. 3- ye hadees gharib hai."
"1934","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' tum logon mein sey koi shakhs kisi bhi nek kaam ko haqeer na samjhey , agar koi nek kaam na mil sakey to apney bhai sey muskura kar miley padhi. , aur agar tum gosht kharido ya haandi pakaao to shorbaa ( salan ( badha lo aur is mein sey thoda sa apney padosi ko dey do.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Shoba ney bhi isey abu-Imraan Jawni key wastey sey riwayat kiya hai."
"1935","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' mardon mein sey bahut sarey mard darja kamaal ko pahunchey padhi. aur aurton mein sey sirf Maryam binte Imran aur Firon ki biwi Aasiya darja kamaal ko pahunchin aur tamam aurton par Aaisha ko isi tarah fazilat hasil hai jis tarah tamam khaanon par sareed ko.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Aaisha aur Anas sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"1936","merey baap ney meri shaadi ki aur logon ko bulaaya, un mein Safwan bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they, unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''gosht ko daant sey noch kar khaao isliye ke wo ziyada jald hazam hota hai, aur lazeez hota hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ko hum sirf Abdul-Karim ki riwayat sey jantey hain aur Abdul-Karim Al Muallim key hafizey key barey mein ehle-ilm ney kalam kiya hai, kalam karney walon mein Ayub Sakhtiyaan bhi hain. 2- is bab mein Aaisha aur Abu-Hurera Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1937","Unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko dekha ke aap ney bakri ki dast ka gosht chhuri sey kaataa , aur is mein sey khaya , phir namaz key liye tashrif ley gaey aur wuzu nahin kiya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Mughira bin Shoba sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1938","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki khidmat mein gosht laya gaya aur aap ko dast pesh ki gaee , aap ko dast bahut pasand thi, chunanche aap ney isey daant sey noch kar khaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Masood , Aaisha , Abdullah bin Jaafar aur abu-Ubaida (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain. 3- abu-Hayyaan ka naam Yahya bin Saeed bin Hayyan hai aur abu-Zara'a bin Amr bin Jareer ka naam Harm hai."
"1939","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko dast ka gosht ziyada pasand nahin tha, lekin aap ko ye kabhi kabhi milta tha, isliye aap usey khaney mein jaldi kartey they kyonkey wo doosrey gosht key muqabley mein jaldi galta hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain."
"1940","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' sirka kya hi behtareen salan hai'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is baab mein Aaisha aur Umme-Haani sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"1941","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' sirka kya hi behtareen salan hai ''."
"1942","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam merey ghar tashrif laye aur farmaya : '' kya tumharey paas ( khaney key liye ( kuch hai? ''main ney arz kya : nahin, sirf roti key chand khushk tukdey aur sirka hai, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' usey laao , wo ghar salan ka mohtaj nahin hai jis mein sirka ho ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib hai, hum isey is sanad sey sirf Umme-Haani ki riwayat sey jantey hain, 2- Umme-Haani ki wafat Ali bin abi Talib key kuch dino baad hui, 3- mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari sey is hadees key barey mein puchha to unhoney kaha : Shaaby ka samaa, Umme-Haani sey mein nahin janta hun, 4- mainey phir puchha : aap ki nazar mein abu-Hamza Sabit bin abi Safiya kaisey hain? unhoney kaha : Ahmed bin Hanbal ka unkey barey mein kalam hai aur merey nazdik wo maqaribul-hadees hain."
"1943","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''sirka kya hi behtareen salan hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadeese-Mubarak bin Saeed ki hadees sey ziyada sahih hai."
"1944","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam taza khajoor key sath tarbuz khatey they . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, 2- baaz logon ney isey « an Hisham bin Urwa an Abeeh an Nabi sallallahu Alehi wasallam » ki sanad sey mursal tariqa sey riwayat ki hai, is mein Aaisha key wasta ka zikr nahin kya hai, Yazeed bin Ruman ney is hadees ko Urwa key wastey sey Aaisha sey riwayat ki hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Anas sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1945","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam taza khajoor key sath kakdi khatey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai, 2- hum isey sirf Ibrahim bin Saad ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
"1946","qabila uraina key kuch log Madina aaye, unhen Madina ki aab o huwa raas nahin aai, isliye Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen sadqey key oonton mein bheja aur farmaya : ''oonton ka peshab aur doodh piyo''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai, 2- ye hadees dusri sanadon sey bhi Anas sey aai hai, abu-Qulaba ney isey Anas sey riwayat ki hai aur Saeed bin abi Aruba ney bhi usey Qatada key wastey sey Anas sey riwayat ki hai."
"1947","mainey Torat mein padha hai ke '' khaney ki barkat khaney key baad wuzu karney mein hai'', mainey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey usey bayan kya aur jo kuch Torat mein padha tha usey bataya to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' khaney ki barkat khaney sey pehley aur uskey baad wuzu karney mein hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ko hum sirf Qais bin Rabee ki riwayat sey jantey hain, 2- aur Qais bin Rabee hadees bayan karney mein zaeef hain, padhi. 3- is bab mein Anas aur Abu-Hurera Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"1948","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam pakhana sey tashrif laye, to aap ki khidmat mein khana pesh kya gaya, Sahaba ney arz kya : kya aap key liye wuzu ka pani laeyn ? aap ney farmaya : '' mujhey namaz key liye jatey waqt wuzu ka hukm diya gaya hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- usey Amr bin Dinar ney Saeed bin Huweris key wastey sey ibne-Abbas sey riwayat ki hai, 3- Ali bin Madini kehtey hain : Yahya bin Saeed ney kaha : Sufiyan Sory khaney sey pehley haath dhona makrooh samajhtey they, wo piyala key nichey chapati rakhna bhi makrooh samajhtey they."
"1949","Banu Murra bin Ubaid ney apni zakat ka maal dey kar mujhey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki khidmat mein bheja , main aap key paas Madina aaya to aap ko muhajrin aur ansaar key bech betha paya, phir aap ney mera haath pakda aur mujhey Umme-Salma (Raziallahu Anha) key ghar ley gaey aur puchha : '' khaney key liye kuch hai? '' chunanche eik piyala laya gaya jis mein ziyada sareed ( shorbey mein tar ki hui roti) aur botiyaan thin, hum usey khaney key liye mutawajjeh huye, main piyaley key kinaron par apna haath maarney laga aur Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam apney samney sey khaney lagey, phir aap ney apney baaein hath sey mera daayan haath pakad kar farmaya : ''Ikrash ! eik jagah sey khaao isliye ke ye eik hi qism ka khana hai'' , phir hamarey paas eik tabaq laya gaya jis mein mukhtalif qism ki khajuren thin, main apney samney sey khaney laga, aur Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ka haath tabaq mein ghoomney laga, aap ney farmaya : ''Ikrash! jahan sey chaho khaao, isliye ke ye eik qism ka nahin hai'' , phir hamarey paas pani laya gaya, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney apney dono haath dhoey aur hatheliyon ki tari sey chehrey, bazu aur sar par masah kya aur farmaya : '' Ikrash ! ye aag par paki hui chiz khaney key baad ka wuzu hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, 2- hum isey sirf Alaa bin Fazal ki riwayat sey jantey hain, Alaa is hadees ki riwayat karney mein munfarid hain, 2- hum Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey Ikrash ki sirf isi hadees ko jantey hain."
"1950","main Anas bin Malik key paas gaya, wo kadu kha rahey they, aur keh rahey they : aey bail! kis qadr to mujhey pasand hai ! kyonkey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam tujhey pasand kartey they . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Hakim bin Jabir sey bhi riwayat hai jisey Hakim apney walid sey riwayat kartey hain."
"1951","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko dekha ke aap Rakabi mein dhoond rahey they yani kadu, us waqt sey mein usey hamesha pasand karta hun. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- ye hadees Anas sey dusri sanadon sey bhi aai hai, 3- riwayat ki gaee hai ke Anas ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key samney kadu dekha to aap sey puchha : ye kya hai? aap ney farmaya : '' ye kadu hai hum us sey apney khaney ki miqdaar badhaatey hain''."
"1952","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''zaitun ka tel khaao aur isey (jism par) lagaao , isliye ke wo Mubarak darkht hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ko hum sirf abdur-Razzaaq ki riwayat sey jantey hain jisey wo Maamar sey riwayat kartey hain. 2- Abdur-Razzaaq is hadees ki riwayat karney mein muztarib (pareshan) hain, kabhi wo isey marfoo riwayat kartey hain aur kabhi shak key sath riwayat kartey huye kehtey hain ke main samajhta hun isey umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kiya hai, aur kabhi kehtey hain : Zaid bin Aslam sey riwayat hai, wo apney baap sey aur wo Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey mursal tareeqe sey riwayat kartey hain."
"1953","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''zaitun ka tel khaao aur isey (jism par) lagaao isliye ke wo Mubarak darkht hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai, hum isey sirf Sufiyan Sory ki riwayat sey Abdullah bin Esa key wastey sey jantey hain."
"1954","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab tum mein sey kisi ka khaadim tumharey khaney ki garmi aur dhuwan bardasht karey , to ( Malik ko chahiye ke khatey waqt ( uska haath pakad kar apney sath bitha ley, agar wo inkar karey to eik luqma ley kar hi usey khila dey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1955","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''salam ko aam karo aur isey phailao , khana khaao aur kafiron ka sar maaro (yani un sey jihad karo) jannat key waris bin jaaogey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Abu-Hurera key wastey sey ibne Ziyad ki riwayat sey Hasan sahih gharib hai. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr , ibne-Umar , Anas , Abdullah bin Salam , Abdur-Rehman bin Aaesh aur Shureh bin Haani (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, Shureh bin Haani ney apney walid sey riwayat ki hai."
"1956","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Rehman ki ibadat karo, khana khaoo aur salam ko aam karo aur isey phailao , jannat mein salamti key sath dakhil ho'o gey.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1957","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''raat ka khana khaao chaahe eik mutthi raddi khajoor hi kyon na ho, isliye ke raat ka khana chhodna budhapey ka sabab hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees munkir hai. 2- hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain, Anbasaa hadees bayan karney mein zaeef hain aur abdul-Malik bin Alaq majhool hain."
"1958","wo Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas gaey, aap key paas khana rakha tha, aap ney farmaya : '' betey ! qarib ho jaao ,Bismillah padho aur apney dahiney haath sey jo tumharey qarib hai usey khaao.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hisham bin Urwa sey :(عن أبي وجزة السعدي an رجل من مزينة an عمر ابن أبي"
"1959","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab tum logon mein sey koi khana khaye to (Bismillah) padh ley , agar shuru mein bhool jaey to ye kahey (بسم الله في أوله وآخره)."
"1960","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''shetan bahut taadne aur chaatney wala hai, us sey khud ko bachaao, jo shakhs raat guzaarey aur uskey haath mein chiknai ki boo ho, phir usey koi bula pahunchey to wo sirf apney aap ko bura bhala kahey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai. 2- ye hadees (Suhail ibne-Abi Saleh an Abeeh an abi Huraira an Nabi sallallahu Alehi wasallam) ki sanad sey bhi marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
"1961","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo shakhs raat guzaarey aur uskey haath mein chiknai ki boo ho phir usey koi bula pahunchey to wo sirf apney aap ko bura bhala kahey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, hum isey Aamash ki riwayat sey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain."
"1962","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (Razi Allah unho se) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Aik momin mein do khasoosiyat jama nahi hoti: bakhli aur bura akhlāq.\"""""
"1963","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah un par ho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Momin saada dil aur sharif hai"
"1964","Abu Mas'ud Al-Ansari RadiAllahu 'Anhu ne riwayat ki ke RasoolAllah SallAllahu Alaihi wa Sallam ne farmaya: \Akele aadmi ki apne ahl-o-aayal par kharch karna bhi sadqah hai.\"""""
"1965","Thawban (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W.) ne farmaya: \Sab se afzal dinar woh dinar hai jo akele mard apne ahal-o-ayyaal par kharch kare.\"""""
"1966","Abu Shuraih Al-'Adawi (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya:\n\n\Meri aankhon ne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko dekha...\"""""
"1967","Abu Shuraih Al-Kabi (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \Mehmaan nawazi teen din ki hai.\"""""
"1968","Safwan bin Sulaim (Razi Allah unho ne) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Jis shakhs ne ek bewa aur ek miskeen ki parwarish aur kharcha kiya"
"1969","Jabir bin Abdullah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Har neki sadqah hai. Aur neki mein se nehi yeh bhi hai ke apne bhai ka chehra muskura kar milo.\"""""
"1970","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (razi Allahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Sachai par qayam rakho. Kyunki sachai neki ki taraf le jaati hai aur neki jannat ki taraf le jaati hai. Insaan sach bolta rehta hai aur sach bolne ki koshish karta rehta hai"
"1971","Ibn 'Umar (razi Allahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab banda (Allah ka) jhoot bola...\"""""
"1972","Aishah (Razi Allah Anha) ne riwayat farmayi: \Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke nazdeek sab se zyada makrooh aadat jhoot thi. Koi shakhs Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki hazoor mein koi baat bayan karte waqt jhoot bolta tha.\"""""
"1973","Anas (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W.A.W.) ne farmaya: \Al-Fuhsh (badtareen gandi baat ya harkat) kisi cheez mein shamil na ho magar usse us cheez ko bigaad deti hai.\"""""
"1974","Abdullah bin 'Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: \Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se tumhare behtaron nek akhlaq wale hain.' Aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) badkari karne wale nahi the.\"""""
"1975","Samurah bin Jundab (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ne farmaya: \n\Apne aap ko Allah ki laanat se mat laanat karo.\"""""
"1976","Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Momin doosron ki izzat-o-namus ki gustakhi nahi karta.\"""""
"1977","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke ek shakhs ne Nabi (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ki huzoor mein hawa par laanat ki."
"1978","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah unho se) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Apni nasab ke mutaliq itna ilm hasil karein ke rishton ko jodne mein aasani ho. Haqeeqat yeh hai ke rishton ka jodna rishtedaaron ke darmian mohabbat ko barhata hai.\"""""
"1979","Hazrat Abdullah bin 'Amr (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat kiya ki Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Koi bhi itni jaldiabadi se kabool nahi hoti jaisa ki Hazrat Abu Bakr (raziyallahu 'anhu) ki du'a kabool hoti thi.\"""""
"1980","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab do aapas mein bad-zubanee karein to un dono kee baat ka bojh us par hai jo pehle shuru kiya.\"""""
"1981","Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Murdon ko badnaam na karo"
"1982","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Muslim ko gali dena nafarmani hai aur us se ladna kufr hai.\"" Zubaid ne kaha: \""Maine Abu Wa'il se kaha: 'Kya aap ne yeh Abdullah se suna?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Ji haan.'\"""""
"1983","Ali (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan Jannat mein kamre hain...\"""""
"1984","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Kitna ajeeb hai ke un mein se koi shakhs Allah ki itaat kare aur apne malik ke haqooq ada kare.\"" Yani ghulaam ke haqooq. Aur Ka'b (razi Allahu anhu) ne kaha: \""Allah aur uske Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sach kaha.\"""""
"1985","Ibn 'Umar (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Zikr hoga k nargis ke tilon par — mujhe lagta hai ke farmaya: Qayamat ke din — ek banda jo Allah (subhanahu wa ta'ala) ka haq ada kare aur apne maula (maalik) ka bhi haq ada kare.\"""""
"1986","Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: \Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: 'Jahan bhi ho"
"1987","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Zann (gumman) se bacho.\"""""
"1988","Hadees ka tarjuma ilmi aur adabi Roman Urdu mein:\n\nAnas (Rizwan Allah un par) ne riwayat farmaya: \Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamare darmiyan itni mulaqat faramate ke mere chhote bhai se farmate: 'Ai Abu Umair! Nughair ne kya kiya?'\"""""
"1989","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \nLogon ne kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah! Aap humse mazaak raashte hain?\"" \nFarmaya: \""Main sachche hi kehta hoon.\"" \n(Hasan)"""
"1990","Anas (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya: \Ek shakhs ne Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) se sawari maangi"
"1991","Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \اے دو کانوں والے!\"" Mahmud ne kaha: \""Abu Usamah ne kaha: 'انہوں نے اس سے صرف مذاق مراد لیا تھا۔'\"""""
"1992","Anas bin Malik (Razi Allah unho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jhoothi qasam kha kar jhoot bolne se jo shakhs bache"
"1993","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hum se rivayat kiya, Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hum se rivayat kiya, Ismail ibn Abi Khalid se, Qays ibn Abi Hazim se, Jarir ibn Abdullah ne kaha: ""Maine Rasoolullah ﷺ ke haath par bait kiya namaz qaim karne, zakah dene, aur har Muslim ki naseehat karne par."" Abu Isa ne farmaya: Ye hadith hasan sahih hai."
"1994","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ne farmaya: \Apne bhai se jhagda na karo.\"""""
"1995","Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) ne riwayat farmayi: \Ek mard ne Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas dakhil hone ki ijazat talab jabke main unke saath thi.\"""""
"1996","Muhammad bin Sirin ne Abu Hurairah se riwayat ki aur mujhe lagta hai unhone (us Nabi se riwayat ki) jinhon ne farmaya: \Apne mahbub ko dosti karo"
"1997","Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jis ke dil mein sarson ke dana barabar takabbur (ghamand) hoga...\"""""
"1998","Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \جس کے دل میں ذرا سی بھی تکبر (غرور) کا ذرہ ہو"""
"1999","Iylas bin Salamah bin Al-Akwa' (رضي الله عنه) ne apne walid (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ne farmaya:\n\n\Insaan yeh tak khud ko barha rakhega jab tak woh zalimon mein likh diya jaye.\"""""
"2000","Jubair bin Mut'im ne apni taraf se riwayat ki ke unke baap ne farmaya: \Logon ne mujhe bataya ke main ghamandhi hoon.\"""""
"2001","Abu Ad-Dardha (Razi Allah Anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Qayamat ke Din Momin ke Paimane par nek akhlaq se zyada koi cheez bhaari nahi hoti. Beshak Allah Ta'ala bad-tameez aur bad-kirdar shakhs se bukhl nahi karta.\"""""
"2002","Abu Ad-Dardha (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \trazw pr achhay akhlaq say zyadh bhary kwyy chyz nhyn rkhy jaty۔ bay shk achhay akhlaq wala shkhs rwzh awr nmaz kay pabnd kay drjh kw pa jayay ga۔\"""""
"2003","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah unho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se pucha gaya ke log jannat mein zyada kis cheez ki wajah se daakhil hote hain."
"2004","Abu Wahb ne riwayat ki ke Abdullah bin Al-Mubarak ne neik akhlaq (good character) ki tafsir bayan ki."
"2005","Abu Al-Ahwas ne apni taraf se riwayat ki, unke baap ne farmaya:\n\n\Maine kaha: 'Aey Allah ke Rasool! Maine ek aadmi ke paas thehra"
"2006","Hudhaifah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Tum aise log na ban jao jinmein apni marzi aur iraada na ho.\"""""
"2007","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jab koi shakhs bimare ko ziyarat kare...\"""""
"2008","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Al-Haya (haya aur sharam) iman ka hissa hai.\"""""
"2009","Abdullah bin Sarjis Al-Muzani (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ne farmaya: \n\Behtareen raasta ikhtiyaar karna nabuwat ki chobhis (24) hisson mein se ek hissa hai.\"""""
"2010","Hazrat Ibn 'Abbas (Razi Allah Unho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Ashajj Abdul Qais se farmaya: \Beshak tum mein do aise sifatain hain jo Allah ko mehboob hain: Hilm aur Burdbarari.\"""""
"2011","Abdullah Muhaimin bin 'Abbas bin Sahl bin Sa'd As-Saidi ne apni taraf se riwayat ki, jo uske baap se naqil ki hai."
"2012","Abu Ad-Darda (Razi Allah anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jise uski naseeb mein halim aur narmi di gayi"
"2013","Ibn 'Abbas (razi Allahu anhuma) ne riwayat ki: \Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Mu'adh bin Jabal (radi Allahu anh) ko Yemen bheja.\"""""
"2014","Anas (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke: \Main ne Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ki khidmat mein das saal guzare. Aap (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne kabhi 'Uff' nahi farmaya aur mujhe kabhi aisa nahi kaha ke 'Tum ne aisa kyun kiya' ya 'Tum ne aisa kyun nahi kiya?' Aur Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) sab se behtarein akhlaq wale the. Maine kabhi khazz (ایک قسم کے ریشمی کپڑے) کو نہیں چھوا اور نہ ہی ریشم (silk) کو۔\"""""
"2015","Abu Abdullah Al-Jadali ne riwayat ki: \Main ne Aisha (R.A) se Rasool Allah (S.A.W) ke akhlaq ke baare mein poocha. Unhon ne farmaya: 'Woh (S.A.W) bad-mazhabhi nahi the...\"""""
"2016","Aishah (rzy allh anha) nay byan frmaya: \myn nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) ky ksy bywy say hasd nhyn hwty thy jtna khdyjh (rzy allh anha) say hasd hwty thy۔\"""""
"2017","Jabir (Razi Allah unho ne) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak tum mein se mujh se sab se zyada mohabbat wale\"""""
"2018","Ibn 'Umar (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \n\Imandaar woh nahi jo doosron ko laanat kare.\"""""
"2019","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah unho se) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: \Mujh kuch aisa sikhado jo ziyada na ho taake main usay ada kar sakun.\"""""
"2020","Sahl bin Mu'adh bin Anas Al-Juhani (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Jis shakhs ne apna ghusse ko roka"
"2021","Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \Koi naujawaan apni umar ki wajah se buzurg ko izzat na de.\"""""
"2022","Abu Hurairah (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \Jannat ke darwaze Peer aur Jumme ke din khol diye jate hain. In (dono) dinon mein"""
"2023","Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke: \Kuch logon ne Ansar se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kuch maanga aur unhon ne unhe diya. Phir unhone phir se maanga"""
"2024","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah ke nazdeek logon mein se sab se buray log woh hain jo...\"""""
"2025","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''qiyamat key din Allah ki nazar mein do rukhey shakhs sey badtar koi nahin hoga.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Anas aur Ammar Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2026","Abu Umamah (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \Al-Haya' aur Al-'Iy iman ki do shaakhain hain.\"""""
"2027","Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziya Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein, jab woh khutba de rahe the, do aaye. Log unki baat se hairan ho gaye."
"2028","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah Anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Sadaqah maal ko kam nahi karti.\"""""
"2029","Ibn 'Umar (Razi Allah unho se) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Zulm Qayamat ke din andheron ka banega.\"""""
"2030","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kabhi kisi bhi khana par aib nahi nikala. Agar unhe pasand aata to kha lete"
"2031","Nafi' ne riwayat ki ke Ibn 'Umar (razi Allahu 'anhu) ne farmaya: \Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) minbar par chadhay aur buland awaz se pukara: 'A tum logon ne jo apni zubaan se Islam qabool kiya...'\"""""
"2032","Abu Sa'eed (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Hilm sirf us shakhs ke liye hai jo kabhi ghalti kar chuka ho.\"""""
"2033","Jabir (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jise koi tohfa diya jaye aur uske paas koi cheez ho to usey qabool karey"
"2034","Usamah bin Zaid (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jis shakhs ke saath koi neki ki gayi...\"""""
"2035","Qatadah bin An-Nu’man (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \n\Jab Allah Ta’ala kisi banda ko pasand karta hai...\"""""
